{"hw":"φορτικός","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">φορτικός</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">φορτ-ικός</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ή</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">όν</span>: (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">φόρτος</span>):—prop. <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">fit for carrying,</b> <span class=\"gk\">πλοῖον φ.</span> a ship <b class=\"lex-tr\">of burden,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.C.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">56.27</span> </span>, <abbr>v.l. in</abbr> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.88</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">of the nature of a burden:</b> metaph. (cf. <span class=\"gk\">φόρτος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11</span> </span> ), <b class=\"lex-tr\">tiresome, wearisome,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τό λέγειν.. φ. καὶ ἐπαχθές</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.4</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοῖς συνοῦσι φ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.456e</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">44a</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">φ. ἀκολούθων ὄχλῳ</span> because of the crowd.., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Nigr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">-ωτάτη λειτουργία</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">most onerous,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">POxy.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">904.9</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(v A. D.)</span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n